  "storefront.policy.page_title": "Buyer & Seller Protection Policy",
  "storefront.policy.page_sub": "How ኢE Pay Wallet escrow protects every order on Etel Gebeya",
  "storefront.policy.for_buyers": "For Buyers",
  "storefront.policy.buyers_heading": "Your payment is held, not sent instantly",
  "storefront.policy.buyers_intro": "When you pay with the ኢE Pay Wallet, your money is not sent to the seller right away. It is held safely by Etel Gebeya until your order is confirmed as received. This protects you from paying for something that never arrives, arrives damaged, or isn't what was described.",
  "storefront.policy.buyers_li1": "<strong>Cancel any time before shipping</strong> -- while your order is still \"New\" or \"Confirmed\", you can cancel it yourself and your payment is refunded to your wallet immediately.",
  "storefront.policy.buyers_li2": "<strong>Confirm when you receive it</strong> -- once the seller marks your order delivered, tap <em>\"I Received My Order\"</em> on your order page to release payment to the seller.",
  "storefront.policy.buyers_li3": "<strong>Auto-confirm after 5 days</strong> -- if you don't confirm manually, payment automatically releases to the seller 5 days after delivery, unless you've reported a problem.",
  "storefront.policy.buyers_li4": "<strong>Report a problem</strong> -- if something is wrong (not delivered, wrong item, defective, not as described), tap <em>\"Report a Problem\"</em> on your order page before the 5 days are up. This pauses the release and our team reviews it.",
  "storefront.policy.for_sellers": "For Sellers",
  "storefront.policy.sellers_heading": "You get paid once the customer confirms",
  "storefront.policy.sellers_intro": "Ship what was ordered, mark each order item as Confirmed → Shipped → Delivered promptly and accurately in your Vendor Panel. Your payout for that item is released automatically once the customer confirms receipt, or 5 days after you mark it delivered if the customer doesn't respond.",
  "storefront.policy.sellers_li1": "Marking an item \"Delivered\" before it has actually reached the customer is a violation and can result in your store being suspended.",
  "storefront.policy.sellers_li2": "If a customer opens a dispute, your payout for that order is held until an admin reviews it. Respond honestly and promptly to any dispute contact -- repeated disputes against your store can lead to review or suspension.",
  "storefront.policy.sellers_li3": "Payouts are sent directly to your Etel Pay wallet (or your configured payout method in Vendor Settings) -- no manual payout request needed for wallet-paid orders.",
  "storefront.policy.dispute_process": "Dispute Process",
  "storefront.policy.dispute_heading": "What happens when a problem is reported",
  "storefront.policy.dispute_intro": "A buyer's dispute report pauses the payout for that order. An Etel Gebeya admin reviews the order, delivery status, and both sides' account of what happened, then decides one of two outcomes:",
  "storefront.policy.dispute_li1": "<strong>Refund the buyer</strong> -- the held payment returns to the customer's ኢE Pay Wallet.",
  "storefront.policy.dispute_li2": "<strong>Release to the seller</strong> -- if the order was fulfilled correctly, the held payment is released to the seller as normal.",
  "storefront.policy.dispute_outro": "Cash on Delivery, Telebirr and CBE Birr orders are not held in escrow (no money passes through the platform wallet for those), so this policy applies specifically to ኢE Pay Wallet payments.",

